---
author: Fenwick Galsworthy
stoa-author-gate-allow: [author: Fenwick Galsworthy]
---
# body

Intended path docs/x.md -> md mode. THE HOLE-CLOSING CONTROL (threat M1): a
careless or hostile committer tries to whitelist a real AUTHORSHIP-claim field by
adding `[author: Fenwick Galsworthy]`. parse_allow_pairs HARD-restricts allow-able
fields to {publisher,vendor,source,provider}, so `author` is dropped BEFORE it can
enter the allow set -> zero pairs -> the author field still BLOCKs. No forged
allow-marker can ever suppress an authorship-claim block.
